                                "sense_id": "f11b1dc1-0619-31f4-915a-4ef4f5006ff9",
                                "text": "I had to relearn how to swim properly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1094f7f8-78bc-4436-8359-4552a6c39c95",
                                "sense_id": "f11b1dc1-0619-31f4-915a-4ef4f5006ff9",
                                "text": "Prison – as was to be relearnt by the French repeatedly in the course of the Algerian war […] – is a marvellous recruiting and training centre."
